# Venus Estates — Architecture

Stack: Vite + React 19 + TypeScript + Tailwind v4 + react-router-dom.

## Folder map

```
src/
  app/           # App shell, providers, router only
  assets/images/ # Static images
  components/    # Shared layout + UI (barrel exports)
  config/        # App constants (not marketing copy)
  content/       # ALL site copy, nav, CTAs, contact (single source)
  features/      # Feature modules (e.g. features/home)
  lib/           # Shared utils (cn, toRoutePath)
  pages/         # Thin route-level pages / stubs
  styles/        # Global CSS + design tokens
  types/         # Shared TypeScript types
  main.tsx       # Entry
```

## Placement rules

- **Copy / links / CTAs / contact / address** → `src/content/site.ts` only. Never hardcode in Navbar, Footer, or pages.
- **New screens** → `src/features/<name>/` with barrel `index.ts`; wire route in `src/app/router`.
- **Shared chrome** → `src/components/layout` (Layout, Navbar, Footer).
- **Reusable primitives** → `src/components/ui`.
- **Types for content shapes** → `src/types`; import from `@/types`.
- **Utils** → `src/lib`; import from `@/lib`.

## Imports

- Use `@/` path alias (maps to `src/`). Prefer `@/content`, `@/components/ui`, etc. over deep relative paths.
- Prefer barrel imports (`@/components/layout`) when exporting from `index.ts`.

## Brand / UI

- This is **Venus Estates**, not Crescent Designs.
- Tokens live in `src/styles/index.css` (`--color-ink`, `--color-accent`, `--color-footer`, fonts).
- Fonts: Outfit (UI) + Syne (display). Do not use Inter / Roboto / system stacks for brand UI.
- Layout wraps every page: Navbar + `<Outlet />` + Footer.

## Do not

- Put marketing strings in components.
- Add page content to `app/` (keep app thin).
- Rename or scatter nav/footer data outside `content/`.
